  "sentences": [
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp6_1",
      "text": "很多人在运动的时候，只想着怎么跑、怎么打，但是忘记了吃的东西也很重要。",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 9040,
      "durationMs": 9040,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p6_sp6_1.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp6_2",
      "text": "运动以前和运动以后，我们需要吃不同的东西。",
      "startMs": 9040,
      "endMs": 15120,
      "durationMs": 6080,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p6_sp6_2.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp6_3",
      "text": "运动以前，不要吃太多。",
      "startMs": 15120,
      "endMs": 17813,
      "durationMs": 2693,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p6_sp6_3.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp6_4",
      "text": "如果吃太多，运动的时候肚子会不舒服。",
      "startMs": 17813,
      "endMs": 22960,
      "durationMs": 5147,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p6_sp6_4.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp6_5",
      "text": "你可以吃一点水果，喝一点水。",
      "startMs": 22960,
      "endMs": 26720,
      "durationMs": 3760,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p6_sp6_5.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp6_6",
      "text": "这样，运动的时候，你的身体会很有精神。",
      "startMs": 26720,
      "endMs": 32160,
      "durationMs": 5440,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p6_sp6_6.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp6_7",
      "text": "运动以后，身体会很累，也会很热。",
      "startMs": 32160,
      "endMs": 36840,
      "durationMs": 4680,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p6_sp6_7.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp6_8",
      "text": "这时候，一定要多喝水。",
      "startMs": 36840,
      "endMs": 40360,
      "durationMs": 3520,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p6_sp6_8.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp6_9",
      "text": "你也可以吃一些鸡蛋或者牛奶，它们对身体很好。",
      "startMs": 40360,
      "endMs": 47840,
      "durationMs": 7480,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p6_sp6_9.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp6_10",
      "text": "好的运动习惯，加上好的吃饭习惯，可以让身体越来越健康。",
      "startMs": 47840,
      "endMs": 56000,
      "durationMs": 8160,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p6_sp6_10.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp6_11",
      "text": "所以，下次去运动的时候，千万别忘了带水。",
      "startMs": 56000,
      "endMs": 62000,
      "durationMs": 6000,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p6_sp6_11.mp3"
    }
  ]
}